                                                "sense_id": "6348edd3-5ae6-3e39-9265-4bdf4e732f6c",
                                                "text": "Considered thus, the performance is a translation into images of bodies on display, as is well demonstrated by Monsieur Jourdain's repeated dressings and undressings."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9808848d-9512-3f00-a3ad-f9efe7975f7e",
